the knowledge base n0106_feel_ternary_logic includes:

the text of the_model is at "sources/0106-feel-ternary-logic.dmn".

rule decision_and_1 with provenance the model at decision DecisionAnd:
the decision and is true if
    the value is true
    and the b is true.

rule decision_and_2 with provenance the model at decision DecisionAnd:
the decision and is false if
    the value is false.

rule decision_and_3 with provenance the model at decision DecisionAnd:
the decision and is false if
    the b is false.

rule decision_or_1 with provenance the model at decision DecisionOr:
the decision or is true if
    the value is true.

rule decision_or_2 with provenance the model at decision DecisionOr:
the decision or is true if
    the b is true.

rule decision_or_3 with provenance the model at decision DecisionOr:
the decision or is false if
    the value is false
    and the b is false.

